-        move its queen to the next safe column.[7][8][14]
-
-  ΓÇó Pruning: after each placement, eliminate attacked squares in future rows; this reduces branching
-        drastically and prevents exploring impossible partial boards, a standard backtracking pruning
-        efficiency gain.[6][8][3]
